summary: Upgraded all 10 existing Paradigm plugin skills to Claude Code Skills v2 format and added 3 new skills (ripple, review, handoff). 8 skills now run in forked subagent contexts with agent routing (paradigm:architect for analysis, paradigm:reviewer for compliance, Explore for data fetching). 5 skills use shell injection to pre-load git/config data before the prompt starts. All 13 skills have tool restrictions. Also fixed a semver sort bug in plugin version detection (3.23.1) that caused every project to report 3.9.0 as the installed version.
